## 1. Project objective

Build a Chrome extension for automating manual Forex strategy backtesting on TradingView.

My workflow:

1. I open a historical Forex chart.
2. I draw native TradingView Long Position or Short Position drawings.
3. I manually determine the entry and take-profit levels.
4. The extension automatically adjusts stop-loss to maintain a configurable risk-to-reward ratio, defaulting to 1.5.
5. I enter three pieces of metadata for each drawing:
   - Trade type.
   - Break time – entry time.
   - Notes (optional).
6. When I finish backtesting, I export all position drawings from the active chart.
7. The extension calculates trade outcomes and historical metrics using candle data.
8. I export the resulting dataset to CSV/Excel for subsequent AI analysis.

Only Forex instruments are in scope.

